    "role": "Keyboards",
    "tenure": "1999-present",
    "bio": {
      "overview": "Voted 'Best Keyboardist of All Time' by Music Radar Magazine, Jordan Rudess is best known as the keyboardist/multi-instrumentalist for Dream Theater.",
      "extended_bio": [
        "Began classical piano training at Juilliard School at age 9, later transitioning to progressive rock",
        "Joined Dream Theater in 1999, appearing on all albums from Metropolis Pt. 2: Scenes from a Memory onward",
        "Developed popular music apps like GeoShred and maintains an active solo career"
      ]
